# Line endings are pinned to LF for every text file in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The render package compares generated output against
# golden files byte for byte, and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# would rewrite those goldens to CRLF. The comparison would then fail on
# Windows while passing everywhere else, which is the worst kind of CI failure
# to debug: the platform you are least likely to be sitting at.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.exe binary
